{"script":"yd_012_09","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]想起大兽潮爆发的那时候，我在巴诺姆的做法，我仍然有些懊悔。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]当时的我向村长建言，不应该龟缩在山上自守，而应主动与深渊联军汇合，一起抗击魔物潮。然而，这个想法遭到了他的反对。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]包括他在内的大部分人认为，山上易守难攻，魔物轻易上不来，就算来了也可以在村里打保卫战。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我当时觉得这种说法甚是荒谬——如果山下的联军都抵挡不住那些魔物，我们这些老弱病残又怎能抗衡？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]那时的我和村长爆发了激烈的争吵。一气之下，我带着自己手下的猎人部队擅自下山支援深渊联军了。虽然战果不算差，但自那以后，我在村里便不受欢迎，最终我只好选择了离开。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]那时我还不够成熟，言行都过于冲动。[r]如果再让我选择一次的话，我可能还是会选择下山，但我会用更温和的方式和大家协商沟通。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]毕竟，很多时候，不理解彼此的双方，正是需要通过沟通来慢慢化解矛盾……回想年轻时的那股冲劲，我不知因此失去了多少朋友，也成为了一匹孤狼……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-亲密3"}